            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.22.20+1SA.22.21+1SA.22.22+1SA.22.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Samueli 22:20–23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha Daudi achimuambira mlavyadzi-sadaka Abiathari, mwana wa Ahimeleki, “Navoya unirehere chira chisibao.” Naye Abiathari achimphirikira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi wauza kpwa Mwenyezi Mlungu achiamba, “Dze! Ro jeshi nchirilunga ndariphaha?” Naye achimjibu achiamba, “Alunge, kpwa kpweli undaaphaha nawe undativya atuo osi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi Daudi phamwenga na hara atue magana sita aphiya hadi ariphofika chidzuho cha Besori, atu magana mairi achisala hipho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atu aho arichwa nyuma kpwa sababu kala akaremwa sana hadi achishindwa kuvuka hicho chidzuho, ela Daudi phamwenga na atu magana mane aenderera kualunga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariphokala anaphiya akpwendamuona Mmisiri mmwenga vuweni, nao achimreha kpwa Daudi. Amupha chakurya na madzi ga kunwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha achimupha chipande cha mkpwahe wa tini na vipanda viiri vya zabibu; naye ariphomala kurya achiphaha mkpwotse, kpwa mana kala ana siku tahu kadzangbwerya wala kunwa madzi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipho Daudi achimuuza, “We u mtumwa wa ani, na ulaphi?” Naye achiamba, “Mino ni barobaro wa kula Misiri, nami ni mtumwa wa Muamaleki mmwenga. Bwana wangu waniricha siku tahu chizotsupa mana kala ni mkpwongo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Swino hwashambuliya Negebu ya Akerethi, Negebu ya seemu ya Juda na Negebu ya Kalebu. Na huchiocha mudzi wa Zikilagi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi achimuuza, “Dze! We unaweza kuniphirika hadi nfike kpwa ro jeshi?” Naye achijibu achiamba, “Uchiapa kpwa Mlungu kukala kundaniolaga wala kunilavya kpwa bwana wangu, mino ndakuphirika hadi phapho.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi ye barobaro wamlongoza Daudi kutserera hadi pho phariphokala ro Jeshi. Ariphofika, aona ro jeshi ra Aamaleki rikamwagikana chila phatu, anarya na kunwa na kuhenda karamu, kpwa sababu ya hizo zewe nyinji arizokala akahala kula tsi ya Afilisti na ya Juda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Daudi achiapiga hangu dziloni hadi dziloni ya siku ya phiri, na taphana ariyesala, isiphokala barobaro magana mane ariopanda ngamia na kuchimbira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi waphaha chila chitu ambacho kala chikatekpwa ni Aamaleki na achiativya achee airi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Takuyaangamika yeyesi, si mdide wala mvyere, ana a chilume wala a chichetu. Na taphana chochosi ambacho chahalwa zewe ambacho tachiyaphahikana, naye Daudi achiviuyiza vyosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye achihala vyaa vyosi vya mangʼondzi na ngʼombe, na atue achivitsunga kuvitanguliza mbere za nyama anjina, kuno anaamba, “Zizi ni zewe za Daudi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi waphiya hadi chidzuho cha Besori kurikokala na hara atu magana mairi. Atu aho kala akarichwa phapho kpwa mana kala akaremwa sana hata taayaweza kumlunga Daudi. Atu aho atuluka kondze ili akamchinjire Daudi na atu ariokala phamwenga naye. Daudi ariphoafikira phephi achialamusa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela atu ayi na asiofwaha, kahi za hinyo ariophiya na Daudi achiamba, “Kpwa kukala atu hinya taayaphiya phamwenga naswi vihani, taundaaganyira hizo zewe huchizoziuyiza, isiphokala chila mmwenga wao andauyizirwa mchewe na anae aphiye vyao.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi achiajibu achiamba, “Hata enehu, msikale achoyo kpwa zewe huchizohewa ni Mwenyezi Mlungu. Mana iye ndiye achiyehurinda na kutiya mikononi ro jeshi richirokpwedza kuhushambuliya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha hivyo mgombavyo ni ani ndiyekuphundzani? Kpwa mana fungu ra aphiyaye vihani, rindakala sawa na fungu ra hiye akalaye nyuma kurinda kambi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi hangu siku iyo Daudi waika dzambo hiro rikale shariya na lagizo ra Iziraeli hadi rero.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
